(and elicit a response). What data is returned depends on the implementation
of the server.

A `POST` request can pass parameters to the server using "Query String
Parameters", as well as the Request Body. For example, in the following request,

> POST /hi/there?hand=wave
>
> <request-body>

The parameter "hand" has the value "wave". The request body can be in multiple
formats. These formats are defined by the MIME type of the request. The MIME
Type can be set using the ``Content-Type`` HTTP header. The most commonly used
MIME types are:

* `multipart/form-data`
* `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`
* `application/json`

This endpoint echoes the HTTP headers, request parameters, the contents of
the request body and the complete URI requested.&item[0][item][1][response][0][name]=POST Raw Text&item[0][item][1][response][0][originalRequest][method]=POST&item[0][item][1][response][0][originalRequest][body][mode]=raw&item[0][item][1][response][0][originalRequest][body][raw]=This is expected to be sent back as part of response body.&item[0][item][1][response][0][originalRequest][url][raw]=https://postman-echo.com/post&item[0][item][1][response][0][originalRequest][url][protocol]=https&item[0][item][1][response][0][originalRequest][url][host][]=postman-echo&item[0][item][1][response][0][originalRequest][url][host][]=com&item[0][item][1][response][0][originalRequest][url][path][]=post&item[0][item][1][response][0][status]=OK&item[0][item][1][response][0][code]=200&item[0][item][1][response][0][_postman_previewlanguage]=json&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][0][key]=Date&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][0][value]=Wed, 27 Apr 2022 11:12:04 GMT&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][1][key]=Content-Type&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][1][value]=application/json; charset=utf-8&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][2][key]=Content-Length&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][2][value]=626&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][3][key]=Connection&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][3][value]=keep-alive&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][4][key]=ETag&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][4][value]=W/"272-MMXI79nhsKjNYJVDka/FIAL+uZg"&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][5][key]=Vary&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][5][value]=Accept-Encoding&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][6][key]=set-cookie&item[0][item][1][response][0][header][6][value]=sails.sid=s%3AVjYfUD3Tx2AzVvPd6_i76zs2zIZ8GvqY.CkOkjRlVRYH%2B9sz%2BcE63s4Zn0%2FK8xrCK7H52K5fkojE; Path=/; HttpOnly&item[0][item][1][response][0][body]={
