m][4][request][auth][oauth1][11][type]=boolean&item[2][item][4][request][method]=GET&item[2][item][4][request][body][mode]=formdata&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][0][key]=code&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][0][value]=xWnkliVQJURqB2x1&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][0][type]=text&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][1][key]=grant_type&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][1][value]=authorization_code&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][1][type]=text&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][2][key]=redirect_uri&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][2][value]=https://www.getpostman.com/oauth2/callback&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][2][type]=text&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][3][key]=client_id&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][3][value]=abc123&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][3][type]=text&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][4][key]=client_secret&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][4][value]=ssh-secret&item[2][item][4][request][body][formdata][4][type]=text&item[2][item][4][request][url][raw]=https://postman-echo.com/oauth1&item[2][item][4][request][url][protocol]=https&item[2][item][4][request][url][host][]=postman-echo&item[2][item][4][request][url][host][]=com&item[2][item][4][request][url][path][]=oauth1&item[2][item][4][request][description]=OAuth1.0a is a specification that defines a protocol that can be used by one
service to access "protected" resources (endpoints) on another service. A
major part of OAuth1.0 is HTTP Request Signing. This endpoint allows you to
check whether the request calculation works properly in the client.

The endpoint supports the HTTP ``Authorization`` header. In case the signature
verification fails, the endpoint provides the four debug values,

* ``base_uri``
* ``normalized_param_string``
* ``base_string``
* ``signing_key``

For more details about these parameters, check the [OAuth1.0a Specification](http://oauth.net/core/1.0a/)

In order to use this endpoint, you can set the following values:

> Consumer Key: ``RKCGzna7bv9YD57c``
>
